  "title": "Cavity dirt material with vertical streaks",
  "purpose": "Build a grime node material where dirt collects in crevices found by ambient occlusion and runs down in vertical streaks from a noise stretched along Z, darkening and roughening a base colour. Use it for buildings, statues, machinery and props that need dirt in the right places.",
