  "limits": "Cavities come from the Ambient Occlusion shader node: ray traced in Cycles, screen-space approximated in EEVEE, so results differ. Streaks follow object Z and do not know about ledges or drip sources. Dirt is colour and roughness only, without bump. Rendered here with Cycles CPU only. Verified in Blender 5.2.1; written for the 4.2 API.",
